  ▲ Unconditional recursion
   ╭─[test.lis:8:5]
 7 │   fn spin(self, other: Counter) -> int {
 8 │     other.spin(self)
   ·     ────────┬───────
   ·             ╰── recurses on every path
 9 │   }
   ╰────
  help: `spin` always calls itself, so it overflows the stack instead of returning. Add a base case that returns without recursing · code: [lint.unconditional_recursion]
